347
00:16:23,280 --> 00:16:24,820
兰迪给了我很多
Randy has given me so much.

348
00:16:25,860 --> 00:16:27,260
眼镜 礼品篮
Sunglasses, gift baskets,

349
00:16:27,720 --> 00:16:29,540
四目相对的高潮
an orgasm with eye contact.

350
00:16:29,780 --> 00:16:31,740
-我的老天 -我知道
- Oh, my God. - I know.

351
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:33,720
通常我都直接把男人的脸推开
Usually, I have to push their face away.

352
00:16:35,260 --> 00:16:36,320
不 你看
No, look.

353
00:16:36,380 --> 00:16:38,400
我们在好莱坞标牌的底端
We're at the foot of the Hollywood sign.

354
00:16:39,180 --> 00:16:40,200
来张自拍啊
Quick selfie?

355
00:16:40,440 --> 00:16:41,920
必须得拍啊 不是吗
I mean, we have to, right?

356
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:45,480
先找到狗 等回来的时候再拍
On the way back, once we find the dog.

357
00:16:45,540 --> 00:16:47,240
这事我们一定得做
Which we are definitely going to do.

358
00:16:49,200 --> 00:16:50,340
詹妮弗·劳伦斯打来了
Jennifer Lawrence is calling.

359
00:16:53,820 --> 00:16:55,520
你居然挂了大表姐的电话
Did you just hang up on J Law?

360
00:16:56,180 --> 00:16:57,680
我很确定这违反了"表"法
I'm pretty sure that's against the J Law.

361
00:16:59,300 --> 00:17:02,480
你现在在外面 是因为你弄丢了兰迪的狗
You're out here because you lost Randy's dog,

362
00:17:02,500 --> 00:17:04,340
那边还站了一个陌生男人
and there's a strange man standing over there,

363
00:17:04,340 --> 00:17:06,100
而你满脑子却只有詹妮弗·劳伦斯
and all you can think about is Jennifer Lawrence.

364
00:17:06,760 --> 00:17:09,100
你刚是说那边站了一个陌生男人吗
Did you just say there's a strange man standing over there?

365
00:17:09,580 --> 00:17:10,560
天啊 是的
Oh, my God, I did.

366
00:17:11,620 --> 00:17:12,116
瞧
Look...

367
00:17:12,116 --> 00:17:14,760
是一个穿着脏兮兮运动服的老阿伯
See there, the old guy in the stained sweat suit.

368
00:17:14,760 --> 00:17:16,460
他肯定是兰迪的邻居
Oh, he must be Randy's neighbor.

369
00:17:16,960 --> 00:17:18,060
他在外面干什么
What's he doing out here?

370
00:17:20,220 --> 00:17:22,440
你找到布鲁诺了
Oh, you found Bruno!

371
00:17:22,700 --> 00:17:24,020
真有意思 刚才有一瞬间
It's so funny, for a second

372
00:17:24,040 --> 00:17:25,440
我还以为他是吃人肉的杀人狂呢
I thought he was the cannibal murderer.

373
00:17:28,420 --> 00:17:30,720
天啊 他手里拿着刀
Oh, my God, he has a knife.

374
00:17:31,120 --> 00:17:32,759
或许他在拆包裹呢
Maybe he's just opening packages.

375
00:17:32,759 --> 00:17:34,682
过来 快过来 乖狗狗
Come here. Come here, big boy.

376
00:17:34,682 --> 00:17:37,867
-快跑 麦克斯 -过来 乖狗狗
- Uh...run, Max! - Come here, big boy.

377
00:17:38,234 --> 00:17:39,422
-快 -这里没啥可吃
- Come on. - Nothing to eat here.

378
00:17:39,422 --> 00:17:41,240
我肉硬又难嚼
I'm stringy and chewy.

379
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:41,420
快
Quick!

380
00:17:42,100 --> 00:17:43,040
快 上去
Quick, up here!

381
00:17:43,340 --> 00:17:45,100
或许直升飞机会看见我们
Maybe the helicopters will see us.

382
00:17:45,300 --> 00:17:46,520
是啊 如果看不见
Yeah, and if not,

383
00:17:46,560 --> 00:17:48,300
我们可以从"O"标牌跳下来自杀
we can throw ourselves off the O.

384
00:17:48,480 --> 00:17:50,880
我拒绝被一个老头吃掉
I refuse to get eaten by an old man...

385
00:17:50,880 --> 00:17:52,360
而且是连银行户头都没有的老头
without a bank account.

386
00:17:53,580 --> 00:17:55,120
食人狂魔会爬上来吗
Can cannibals climb?

387
00:17:55,480 --> 00:17:58,120
他们不是"爬梯狂魔" 所以应该没事
Well, they're not called "Climbables," So that's good.

388
00:17:58,820 --> 00:18:00,200
他还在那里吗
Is he still there?

389
00:18:00,580 --> 00:18:01,401
我们很快就会知道了
Well, we'll know in a second

390
00:18:01,401 --> 00:18:02,996
因为在一个饥饿的食人族旁边大叫
'cause you're screaming within earshot

391
00:18:03,320 --> 00:18:04,580
他听得到好吗
of a hungry people-eater.

392
00:18:04,900 --> 00:18:08,300
你被包围了 把你的双手举起来
You are surrounded! Put your hands up!

393
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:15,560
麦克斯 警察来了
Max, the police are here.

394
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:17,189
我们安全了 安全了
We're safe. We're safe.

395
00:18:17,189 --> 00:18:18,840
那是你而已
Speak for yourself.

396
00:18:18,840 --> 00:18:21,080
严格说来 我应该在康州服在家软禁刑法
I'm technically under house arrest in Connecticut.

397
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:29,460
我让他吃冰淇淋
I let him eat ice cream.

398
00:18:30,100 --> 00:18:31,400
这是他应得的
He deserves it.

399
00:18:31,500 --> 00:18:33,000
谁昨天过得很不顺呀
Who had a rough day yesterday?

400
00:18:34,360 --> 00:18:36,760
真的很抱歉 兰迪
I am really sorry, Randy.

401
00:18:36,760 --> 00:18:39,400
你一定认为我是一个不负责任的人
You must think I'm as irresponsible as I am.

402
00:18:40,460 --> 00:18:42,120
你该出场了 快哭着
This is where you cry

403
00:18:42,120 --> 00:18:43,860
告诉他都是你的错 而我是一个完人
and tell him it's all you and I'm perfect.

404
00:18:45,640 --> 00:18:46,540
抱歉 我刚在想
Sorry, I was just thinking,

405
00:18:46,560 --> 00:18:49,160
那狗的牙齿和牙龈看起来比我的还健康
that dog's gums and teeth look healthier than mine.

406
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:51,920
我至今仍不敢相信我的邻居
I still can't believe my neighbor

407
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:53,720
居然是食人狂魔沃尔特·加里·万斯
was Walter Gary Vance the cannibal.

408
00:18:54,100 --> 00:18:56,540
老实说 这比住在科特妮·洛芙隔壁还糟得多
And honestly, it was way worse living next to Courtney Love.

409
00:18:57,740 --> 00:18:59,120
其实我要求也不高
I mean, it's not that hard.

410
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:00,660
蓝色垃圾箱是可回收物
Blue bins are for recycling,

411
00:19:01,020 --> 00:19:02,040
每周二是街道清扫
Tuesdays are street cleaning,

412
00:19:02,320 --> 00:19:03,580
不要在我门廊吸毒
Don't do heroin on my porch.

413
00:19:05,400 --> 00:19:07,760
是啊 那是一项私家车道上的"运动"
Yeah, that's a driveway sport.

414
00:19:09,920 --> 00:19:12,520
布鲁诺以前也曾跑出去过
Look, Bruno's gotten out before,

415
00:19:12,640 --> 00:19:15,180
但你们特意跑出去找他
but the fact that you went out there to look for him

416
00:19:15,180 --> 00:19:16,340
还冒着生命危险
and risked your lives.

417
00:19:16,540 --> 00:19:18,820
你们真勇敢
I mean, you were fearless.

418
00:19:19,820 --> 00:19:21,000
随便吧 或许有那么一点吧
Pfft, whatever. Maybe a little.

419
00:19:25,520 --> 00:19:28,000
这下好了 詹妮弗·劳伦斯拜拜了
Ugh, great. Jennifer Lawrence just passed.

420
00:19:28,160 --> 00:19:29,060
她死了吗
She's dead?

421
00:19:31,300 --> 00:19:33,420
不 她跟我的电影拜拜了
No, she passed on the movie.

422
00:19:33,420 --> 00:19:35,020
那是她的损失
It's her loss.

423
00:19:36,180 --> 00:19:37,500
好吧 是你的损失 但我觉得欠你人情
Well, it's your loss, but I feel like I owe you

424
00:19:37,500 --> 00:19:39,400
毕竟你冒着生命危险去找我男朋友的狗
for risking your life to find my boyfriend's dog.

425
00:19:40,400 --> 00:19:42,858
不是说你是我的男朋友啊
Not that you're my boyfriend,

426
00:19:42,858 --> 00:19:46,576
因为超恶心
'cause gross.

427
00:19:46,900 --> 00:19:48,700
能当你的男朋友 真是三生有幸
I'd be lucky to be your boyfriend.

428
00:19:49,440 --> 00:19:51,560
提前是我是 但幸好我不是
If I was, which yuck, I'm not.

429
00:19:53,580 --> 00:19:54,740
大家安安
Hey, everybody.

430
00:19:55,880 --> 00:19:58,980
瞧瞧 我的精神已经升华了
Look, I'm spiritually evolved now.

431
00:19:59,640 --> 00:20:03,040
是啊 冥想让我的膝盖难受
Yeah, you know, the meditating was screwing up my knees,

432
00:20:03,060 --> 00:20:06,460
所以我从公车站的一个印度女人那买了这装束
so I bought this getup from an Indian woman at a bus stop.

433
00:20:06,920 --> 00:20:09,120
印度跟冥想差不多 这样轻松多了
Yeah, it's a lot easier.

434
00:20:10,480 --> 00:20:12,320
苏菲 这束花真美
Sophie, those flowers are beautiful.

435
00:20:12,900 --> 00:20:13,500
是啊
Yeah...

436
00:20:14,700 --> 00:20:16,120
这是送你的
and they're for you.

437
00:20:18,653 --> 00:20:21,530
这束花会对我做什么吗
What're they gonna do to me?

438
00:20:23,613 --> 00:20:27,200
它们代表的是爱意和善意之举
They're an act of love and kindness.

439
00:20:27,200 --> 00:20:30,979
苏菲 这真是你对我说过最好听的话了
Sophie, that's literally the nicest thing you've ever said to me.

440
00:20:30,979 --> 00:20:32,020
是啊
Oh, yeah.

441
00:20:32,020 --> 00:20:34,400
我不知道是不是因为我灵气变干净了
I don't know if it's my aura's clean,

442
00:20:34,400 --> 00:20:37,320
还是这颗价值12.95元的眉心痣作祟
or it's the 12.95 Bindi dot I'm wearing,

443
00:20:37,340 --> 00:20:39,340
但我是真的发自内心的
but I really do mean it.

444
00:20:39,560 --> 00:20:41,280
苏菲 别吃 那是狗吃的冰淇淋
Oh, Sophie, no. That's dog ice cream.

445
00:20:41,320 --> 00:20:43,020
少多管闲事 婊砸
Mind your own business, bitch!

446
00:20:46,380 --> 00:20:47,640
一秒钟破功
And we're back.
